**File**: [class-ofast-admin-url.php](file:///c:/Users/bodma/Local%20Sites/ofast-x-dev/app/public/wp-content/plugins/ofast-x/modules/admin-studio/class-ofast-admin-url.php)

- **Line 193**: `get_return_url()` defaults to `admin.php?page=ofast-admin-tweaks` but should redirect to White Label page
