### 6. ⚠️ File location: White Label files still inside `modules/admin-studio/`

All White Label related files are still physically in `modules/admin-studio/`:
- `class-ofast-whos-admin.php`
- `class-ofast-admin-url.php`
- `class-ofast-menu-editor.php`

While this works, it's inconsistent with the new standalone module identity. The files reference assets from `admin-studio/assets/`.

> [!NOTE]
> This is a **low priority** cosmetic issue. Moving files would require updating all `require_once` paths in core and asset URLs. We can defer this.

