### 8. ⚠️ Admin URL CSS loads on wrong page

**File**: [class-ofast-admin-url.php](file:///c:/Users/bodma/Local%20Sites/ofast-x-dev/app/public/wp-content/plugins/ofast-x/modules/admin-studio/class-ofast-admin-url.php#L733-L745)

